{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfaCzYfsdbKA1Zy3fSoZU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the candidate and it passes the self-check, which printed `OK` with a finite ELPD-LOO of −931.3 on its short smoke fit. The incumbent's full fit scored −952.4, but that was a production fit, so the two numbers aren't directly comparable. Novelty, convergence and speed were not checked; admission tests those.\n\n**Model:** `personal_streak_aversion_lapse_balance`, a refinement of the incumbent `lapse_individual_balance_alternation`.\n\n**What it keeps:** each person's own ideal switching rate, their own penalty on unequal heads/tails counts, and their own rate of guessing on some trials.\n\n**The one change:** people also count the longest streak of identical flips as a sign of non-randomness, and how much it counts differs from person to person. The streak is measured relative to its maximum possible length for the sequence, and each person's weight is drawn from a population distribution.\n\n**Why:** it targets two discrepancies in the critique:\n- Among pairs matched on alternation rate, people pick the sequence without a streak at its start or end more often than the model predicts (0.608 observed vs 0.529 predicted).\n- People differ more in whether they pick the sequence with the shorter longest streak than the model produces (spread across people 0.242 observed vs 0.221 predicted).\n\nNeither survives the correction for testing several statistics at once (q = 0.12 for both), so they are leads rather than firm gaps.\n\n**Risk:** in the smoke fit, 8.2% of trials had high Pareto-k values, well above the 1% tolerance, so its ELPD-LOO may be flagged unreliable. That is likely common to per-person models like this one, but it could keep the model from being exported as the winner even if it scores best.\n\nFiles are in `…/experiment1/model_loop/iter_4/candidate_4/`:\n- `hypothesis.md`\n- `model_name.txt`\n- `candidate.py`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3518,"cache_read_input_tokens":65022,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3518,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"daf56539-4427-4e3c-8c3c-a03e13f969e3","uuid":"5417f435-07ce-4783-b9d1-011a53123b6a","timestamp":"2026-09-30T19:52:26.311Z","request_id":"req_011CfaCzYA7ChJYf68SGmhZk"}
